# Pundit Policy Conventions

- One policy per model: `app/policies/entity_policy.rb`.
- Default deny via `ApplicationPolicy`; allow only explicitly.
- Define a `Scope` class for `policy_scope` (store/multi-tenant filtering).
- Inherit from `ApplicationPolicy`.
- Controllers call `authorize @resource` on every action.
- Index actions use `policy_scope(Model)`, not `Model.all`.
- Test every action for each relevant role (admin, gestor, visitor).
